amespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">년 청소년과 함께하는</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">‘</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">나라사랑 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">UCC </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">공모전</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">’(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">연 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">회</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">전</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">후반기 시행</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">을 아래와 같이 개최하오니 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">가</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">배경</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">육군은 육해공 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">군 본부가 위치한 계룡대를 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2011</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">년부터 전면 개방하여 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">‘</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">나라사랑 계룡대견학</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">’ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">체험 프로그램을 운영하고 있으며</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">이와 연계하여 학생들에게 나라사랑에 대한 순수 창작활동의 기회를 통해 국가관 및 안보의식을 함양시키기 위해 실시하는 행사입니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">나</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">나라사랑 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">UCC</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">공모전</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">제 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">회</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">응모대상 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">대한민국 청소년</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-ra