딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">분 이내</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">행정사항</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">청소년과 함께하는 나라사랑 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">UCC</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">공모전은 연 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">회</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">반기단위</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">시행합니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">작품은 국내외 타 공모전에 출품되지 않은 순수 창작물이여야 합니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">응모작은 반환되지 않으며</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">당선작은 다양한 온</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">?</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">오프라인 미디어를 통해 육군홍보물로 활용할 수 있습니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 4) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">당선작의 저작권은 육군본부에 귀속됩니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 5) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">심사 결과에 따라 발표일과 수상인원은 변동될 수 있습니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-as